rapper so-input aps-0202-so-wrapper-c2797dac-67f0-4676-86eb-327aceb202f7"><div class="aps-0202-so-field-wrap"><select name="c2797dac-67f0-4676-86eb-327aceb202f7" data-tid="wfp-drop-down-list-1" data-type="B1B3C367-AC2B-5F6F-32B0-309E5B002D49" data-so-type="ddl;1" data-msg="Labuan Companies"><option value="Please select one">Labuan Companies</option><option value="areas-of-business/labuan-structures/protected-cell-companies">Protected Cell Companies</option><option value="areas-of-business/labuan-structures/partnerships">Partnerships</option></select><span class="aps-0202-so-line"></span></div><div class="so-err-msg"></div></div></div><div class="com com-56ebdbc0-982c-40f9-96df-765806ce8016"><div class="aps-0037-so-wrapper line-placement-center aps-0037-so-wrapper-8f3ce320-fe34-4353-9710-181d9c7b293d"><hr></div></div></div><div class="col col-a67afcc0-a9c1-4ede-9f81-b83d10a0ba79"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row row-290be092-e9b5-4e5e-8bce-1c1e5776a89e"><div class="mol mol-283ce286-b034-4ee7-a088-ca6e654ad44a"><div class="col col-b2365b8a-af19-4021-9fff-959608237837"><div class="com com-b5dc0465-483d-42a9-9c1c-53a274b67510"><div data-so-type="txt;1" class="aps-0036-so-wrapper  list-gap-s font-452799C9-FA75-4213-AA28-F7157EA752C0  aps-0036-so-wrapper-ff7e493b-9fa1-48fb-8cf1-3d00bd9b2f8b"><div class="a-inner-text"><p>Overview</p></div></div></div><div class="com com-e6fd90fc-a36f-4348-80b4-e381fe332135"><div class="mol mol-0598c85d-5e24-434a-b8cf-4b4b7acf8dcd"><div class="col col-d657cf80-ff3d-4b54-b3cb-15b3090450eb"><div class="com com-ab2c349c-5f7e-4349-8835-1a14ab9167a8"><div data-so-type="txt;1" class="aps-0036-so-wrapper  list-gap-s font-8C65CD72-BB8B-47C5-8E0E-355356B24AFF  aps-0036-so-wrapper-7c47717d-d4ba-43a4-a906-19d25badfb1f"><div class="a-inner-text"><p>With Labuan IBFC’s strategic location in the heart of Asia, it is only natural for many Asian firms to opt Labuan as their domicile. Being close to their home markets as well as located in the same time zone with other major cities in the region, businesses in the Centre can be transacted more conveniently and at competitive costs compared to other markets. Labuan companies also have the added advantage of being able to establish offices anywhere outside of Labuan, provided it meets the substantial activity requirements. Incorporation of Labuan companies in Labuan IBFC is required to be undertaken through a Labuan trust company, which will conduct due diligence on the prospective client. On-line company registration will be done via COR@L System that provides convenience and security to its users with real-time access.<br></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row row-d3e82b30-cf2f-41c0-8657-c692e11b8bb2"><div class="mol mol-3cbf1e35-afb9-42ec-9e8d-30df9b90a8b7"><div class="col col-9fcdb9e4-18eb-44a7-b117-702c3b36d0ac"><div class="com com-e74a6b1a-9bcf-42a0-9f3b-9d05bfa8da9a"><div data-so-type="txt;1" class="aps-0036-so-wrapper  list-gap-s font-452799C9-FA75-4213-AA28-F7157EA752C0  aps-0036-so-wrapper-efe710ea-87b3-4ee3-a15e-1faf621bc5e9"><div class="a-inner-text"><p>Application Procedure</p></div></div></div><div class="com com-9878fe52-2b7f-420a-958d-8b2fde96a229"><div class="mol mol-b5ab74b6-1364-40d9-9291-1de8951bf09b"><div class="col col-a162d436-e24f-4e16-b9f6-02f67ca759af"><div class="com com-bc26b02a-79b3-490c-a678-02b7a92aea92"><div data-so-type="txt;1" class="aps-0036-so-wrapper  list-gap-s font-8C65CD72-BB8B-47C5-8E0E-355356B24AFF  aps-0036-so-wrapper-38932f40-be73-40ed-8f0f-266ee6c244d3"><div class="a-inner-text"><p>Applicant must appoint a licensed Labuan trust company as its incorporation agent.<br></p></div></div></div><div class="com com-e6ec1ca8-0e8b-48cb-b717-76edf9705797"><a data-so-type="btn;1" class="aps-0030-so-wrapper  hvr-normal font-D6715655-7F24-45EF-8463-ADB1866B5F1D btn-padding-custom  font-icon-textless aps-0030-so-wrapper-913afe32-7ad6-4983-a63a-3ce5e5175c43" data-so-popup="" data-so=";" href="https://www.labuanfsa.gov.my/financial-institutions-directory?f=6937a3a80f6995c77d871d3b" target="_self"><div class="a-inner-text">View List of Labuan Trust Companies</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row row-d771a91c-fa2d-452a-9a2a-aa395720ce41"><div class="mol mol-d207f6f0-8395-44be-82ad-45328b458265"><div class="col col-726b4bf8-7614-4fc2-b990-1d90dd31ded8"><div class="com com-843df979-c2c9-4c3f-a663-24af628a3298"></div></div></div></div><div class="row row-84a20d28-b344-42a2-8cba-7be3b4f3af64"><div class="mol mol-0152ca9a-40fd-41fc-84a7-5a17df6a6c9f"><div class="col col-4e00b348-c0d0-44e3-95a2-450e946a632f"><div class="com com-f22dba09-56e6-4918-a912-91ce0ab8d04b csl-aob-subpage"><div class="slick-carousel slick-carousel-plugin-f22dba09-56e6-4918-a912-91ce0ab8d04b" data-id="f22dba09-56e6-4918-a912-91ce0ab8d04b">
